id: cheered
name: Cheered
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 10
# Not a Combat Condition: what the Spectator State's (1) gives an Ally, held on the Spectator's clock - its stacks the
# Spectator's base Tier.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Cheered on by a Spectator: Combat Rolls 1(bT) higher until the start of their next turn, or until they leave the Spectator State.
text: >
  Spectator (1): Increase their Combat Rolls by 1(bT) until the start of your next turn or until you leave the Spectator State (whichever occurs first).

---

[passive]
combatRolls += stacks;
